{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/WelcomeToTheGame.gif?t=1747054710\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WELCOME TO THE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nocturnal Throne is an <strong>action rogue-lite</strong> where you go through an <strong>endless</strong> series of levels <strong>collecting items</strong>, <strong>upgrading weapons</strong> and <strong>levelling up</strong> your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/EnemiesLevelUpWithYou.gif?t=1747054710\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ENEMIES LEVEL UP WITH YOU</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies <strong>never</strong> stop getting stronger. The <strong>longer</strong> you play, the <strong>harder</strong> they get. Enemies also have <strong>buffs</strong> which can modify them in many different ways: like making them <strong>explode</strong>, or <strong>freeze you</strong>, or <strong>set you on fire</strong>, or even <strong>making them be made of solid gold</strong>. The combinations of enemies are truly <strong>endless</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/GIF_004.gif?t=1747054710\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE ONLY LIMITS ARE YOUR IMAGINATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect items</strong> that improve your stats. <strong>There are no limits</strong>, collect as many items as you want and become <strong>unbelievably strong</strong>. There are dozens of items to find and discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/GIF_003.gif?t=1747054710\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PUSHING YOU TO YOUR BREAKING POINT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete <strong>challenges</strong> to unlock new <strong>items</strong>, <strong>weapons</strong> and <strong>characters</strong>. There is a plentiful amount of challenges for you to do, <strong>pushing your skills and builds to the limits</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3718040?t=1747054710","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3718040?t=1747054710","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/b42c0715561a5cff5f385ac407cf71aa3394b0b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747054710","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/b42c0715561a5cff5f385ac407cf71aa3394b0b2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747054710","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/WelcomeToTheGame.gif?t=1747054710\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WELCOME TO THE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nocturnal Throne is an <strong>action rogue-lite</strong> where you go through an <strong>endless</strong> series of levels <strong>collecting items</strong>, <strong>upgrading weapons</strong> and <strong>levelling up</strong> your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/EnemiesLevelUpWithYou.gif?t=1747054710\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ENEMIES LEVEL UP WITH YOU</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies <strong>never</strong> stop getting stronger. The <strong>longer</strong> you play, the <strong>harder</strong> they get. Enemies also have <strong>buffs</strong> which can modify them in many different ways: like making them <strong>explode</strong>, or <strong>freeze you</strong>, or <strong>set you on fire</strong>, or even <strong>making them be made of solid gold</strong>. The combinations of enemies are truly <strong>endless</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/GIF_004.gif?t=1747054710\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE ONLY LIMITS ARE YOUR IMAGINATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect items</strong> that improve your stats. <strong>There are no limits</strong>, collect as many items as you want and become <strong>unbelievably strong</strong>. There are dozens of items to find and discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/GIF_003.gif?t=1747054710\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PUSHING YOU TO YOUR BREAKING POINT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete <strong>challenges</strong> to unlock new <strong>items</strong>, <strong>weapons</strong> and <strong>characters</strong>. There is a plentiful amount of challenges for you to do, <strong>pushing your skills and builds to the limits</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Goutrial Game Dev"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/07f84c6b24f062dd91f6d6c3bf4bf2b94c8e89f4/header.jpg?t=1747054710","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Min